    "rawResponseText": "For a **hotel conversion in Mexico** where **affiliation flexibility** is the top priority, the most relevant options are the soft-brand or collection platforms that let an owner keep more of the property’s identity while still gaining distribution and loyalty benefits[1][4][9].\n\nThe brands/collections most worth considering are:\n\n- **Wyndham Trademark Collection** and **Wyndham Registry Collection** — the Mexico-focused result specifically says these are particularly relevant for upper midscale and upscale resorts and allow owners to maintain operational flexibility and a strong sense of place[3].\n- **Marriott Autograph Collection**, **Tribute Portfolio**, and **Design Hotels** — these are cited as soft-brand/collection options that preserve individuality while connecting to a global operator network[5][14].\n- **Hilton Curio Collection** and **Tapestry Collection** — both are soft-brand collections aimed at independent-style hotels seeking more flexible affiliation[5].\n- **IHG Vignette Collection** — highlighted as a conversion-oriented soft brand with flexibility for owners who want a lighter-touch affiliation[5].\n- **Accor MGallery** and **Emblems Collection** — positioned as upscale-to-luxury lifestyle collections with preserved local identity[5].\n- **Radisson Individuals** — described as a flexible, conversion-oriented model across multiple markets[5].\n- **Voluntary/independent collections** such as **Leading Hotels of the World**, **Preferred Hotels & Resorts**, and **Small Luxury Hotels of the World** — these are especially relevant if the owner wants *maximum contract and operational independence* rather than a traditional corporate soft brand[2][12].\n\nIf your priority is **the most flexibility possible**, the strongest fit is usually the **voluntary collections** because they are specifically described as offering *shorter-term agreements, more flexibility, and independence in the contract* than corporate soft-brand chains[2]. If the priority is **flexibility plus stronger global distribution and loyalty support**, then **Wyndham Registry/Trademark, Marriott Autograph/Tribute, Hilton Curio/Tapestry, and IHG Vignette** are the main brands to evaluate first[3][5][14].",
